   "gen": "comm"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "Industrial space in the Langley submarket (20.9M sq ft) was 5.7% vacant in the third quarter of 2026, asking $19.16 per sq ft net plus $6.50 in additional rent, with 122,394 sq ft under construction. Across Metro Vancouver vacancy was 4.0%.",
   "gen": "comm"
  },
